patches.bound-cache.patch:
diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 928b4df..4a9a973 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@

 ## Unreleased

+- Assign distinct native metric producer slots across listeners, reclaim runtime-thread slots, use snapshot route positions without a request-time hash lookup and share final-header timestamps. Header-name cache trials were withdrawn after CPU qualification; see the [follow-up record](docs/validation-hyper-instructions5-2026-10-24.md).
